// round 190ov: LYNX's later own engines (the effects Live's Drum Buss, Erosion, Corpus, Vinyl Distortion, Spectral Time and
// Spectral Resonator import onto, the transient designer, LYNX Model). Names: a web search only (docs/PLUGINS-PACK.md).
// Rollup 0.1.31 step 6 (owner decision): Tetra, Helix and Braid export as LYNX Fourfold, LYNX Wavecoil and LYNX Duoloom
// (Sequential's Tetra, Line 6's Helix Native and Mutable Instruments' Braids are other makers' products), and Harmonia as
// LYNX Chimefield (Cherry Audio's Harmonia synth); inside LYNX the engines keep their names. Web search only, 2026-11-21.
// Held back at 0 in step 6 (CI plugins run 44975814572: a crash in plugexporttest's reference render, a state that didn't
// save back byte for byte); round 190pq fixed both and builds the three synths as CLAP, VST3 and LV2 (docs/PLUGIN_EXPORT.md).
